<SeoGuideLayout
  pathname="/palworld-console-commands/"
  breadcrumbLabel="Console commands"
  intro={SEO_INTROS['/palworld-console-commands/']!}
>
  <h2>Palworld admin commands and spawn syntax</h2>
  <p>
    Open the admin console on dedicated servers with the password Pocketpair documents for 1.0.x. Offline worlds
    may expose different flags—always check patch notes when a hotfix renames cheat codes.
  </p>
  <h2>Palworld cheat codes for items and XP</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>GiveItem</code> — spawn by Palworld item IDs (see item spawner hub)</li>
    <li>Teleport coordinates for towers, bases and Jetragon nests</li>
    <li>XP and Technology Points boosts for private progression tests</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Palworld spawn command examples</h2>
  <p>
    Copy commands into your server console; never paste untrusted strings from random forums. Pair this list with
    our trainer guide if you prefer hotkeys over typing admin lines each session.
  </p>
</SeoGuideLayout>
